# Web dev server (`pnpm -C apps/web dev` / `make dev-web`). Copy to apps/web/.env.local (git-ignored; Next loads it).
# The web app needs no secret: keys stay in the API. Never create a NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable holding a key, secret or
# token (scripts/agents/validate-architecture.sh fails on it).

# Where `next dev` proxies /api/* (next.config.ts). Docker and production route /api through Caddy instead.
DEV_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Not read from this file: `apps/web/scripts/xr-check.mjs` (headless IWER check) reads these from the shell
# environment, e.g. `MW_ANGLE=vulkan node scripts/xr-check.mjs`.
#   MW_ANGLE      ANGLE backend of headless Chromium: swiftshader (default) or vulkan (needed to see the world)
#   MW_CHROMIUM   path of the Chromium binary (default ~/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1248/chrome-linux64/chrome)
